  "question": {
    "text": "Let one observation equal to the mean is added to&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi></math> observations. If the variance changes from <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>78</mn></math> to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>72</mn></math>, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi></math> is equal to",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "12",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Adding mean to the observations does not change the value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8721;</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></msub><mo>-</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math>, hence,&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mi>n</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></munderover><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>78</mn><mn>72</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>78</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>72</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn></math></p>",
